        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Billy Corgan, Yelena Yemchuk\n- Bands: The Smashing Pumpkins\n- Albums: Adore\n- Songs: Perfect, Ava Adore, Crestfallen\n- Topics: singles, promotional singles, artwork\n\nFacts:\n- The Smashing Pumpkins released \"Adore\" as their fourth album.\n- \"Perfect\" was the final commercial vinyl single from \"Adore\".\n- Two songs were subsequently released from \"Adore\" as promotional singles.\n- \"Crestfallen\" was one of the promotional singles released after \"Perfect\".\n- Ukrainian photographer Yelena Yemchuk created the artwork for one of those promotional singles.",
