        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Crestfallen\", \"Perfect\", \"To Sheila\", Adore\n- People: Yelena Yemchuk\n- Companies/Organizations: The Smashing Pumpkins\n- Topics: single artwork, promotional singles\n\nFacts:\n- Yelena Yemchuk was born on April 22, 1970.\n- Yelena Yemchuk is a Ukrainian professional photographer, painter, and film director.\n- Yelena Yemchuk is best known for her work with The Smashing Pumpkins.\n- Adore is The Smashing Pumpkins' 1998 album.\n- \"Crestfallen\" is a track on The Smashing Pumpkins' 1998 album Adore.\n- The artwork for the \"Crestfallen\" single was created by Yelena Yemchuk.\n- \"Perfect\" was the final commercial single from Adore.\n- \"Crestfallen\" and \"To Sheila\" were subsequently released as promotional singles from Adore.",
